年，詔徵爲侍中、中書令，遂抗表不應召。遣諸子還京師，獨與母留，築室郡之西郭。明帝下詔曰：「夫超然榮觀，風流自遠；蹈彼幽人，英華罕值。故長揖楚相，見稱南國；高謝漢臣，取貴良史。新除侍中、中書令朏，早藉羽儀，夙標清尚，登朝樹績，出守馳聲。遂斂跡康衢，拂衣林沚，抱箕潁之餘芳，甘憔悴而無悶。撫事懷人，載留欽想。宜加優禮，用旌素概。可賜床帳褥席，俸以卿祿，常出在所。」時國子祭酒廬江何胤亦抗表還會稽。永元二年，詔徵朏爲散騎常侍、中書監，胤爲散騎常侍、太常卿，並不屈。三年，又詔徵朏爲侍中、太子少傅，胤散騎常侍、太子詹事。時東昏皆下在所，使迫遣之，值義師已近，故並得不到。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":19,"last_line":19,"revision_id":1506954,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"諸子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"未名角色／引古或群體，保留來源錨點，候選與限制另見review。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"009_vr4_220","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-mother"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-mingdi"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"楚相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"未名角色／引古或群體，保留來源錨點，候選與限制另見review。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"漢臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"未名角色／引古或群體，保留來源錨點，候選與限制另見review。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"朏","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-fei"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p005:m0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"何胤","kind":"person","person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","status":"contextual_provisional",