"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p005:m0180","start":180,"end":181,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-wangyan"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p005:m0190","start":190,"end":191,"surface":"晏","kind":"person","person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-wangyan"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p005:m0193","start":193,"end":194,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"晏甚憚之的之回指𤅢。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p006","unit_id":"xieyue-complete","text":"加領右軍將軍。兄朏在吳興，論啓公事稽晚，𤅢輙代爲啓，上見非其手迹，被問，見原。轉侍中，領太子中庶子，豫州中正。永泰元年，轉散騎常侍，太子詹事。其年卒。年四十五。贈金紫光祿大夫。謚簡子。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":63,"last_line":63,"revision_id":2400356,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p006:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"朏","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-fei"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p006:m0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"𤅢","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p006:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-mingdi"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p006:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"兄朏論啓、𤅢代啓，帝看出不是所署朏的手迹；此其依代啓句法暫繫朏，不作書法事實。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-fei"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi:p007","text":"轉長水校尉領本職沖之造安邊論欲開屯田廣農殖建武中明帝使沖之巡行四方興造大業可以利百姓者㑹連有軍事事竟不行","text_layer":"received_chapter","source_position":{"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":352,"last_line":354,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/nanqi052-zuchongzhi/projection.json","editorial_paragraph_boundary":true,"revision_id":"787dd9a7da495542e8f17c26c96900ce37b2c211"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi:p007:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"沖之","kind":"person","person_id":"vcm_d77_tsz_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳具名字文逺及宋齊兩朝機械曆學官序，不與祖逖等同姓人接"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi:p007:w0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"安邊論","kind":"work","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","work_id":"w-anbianlun-nanqi052-reference","interpretation_note":"原明沖之造安邊論；書題可辨，作者報告與作品年代仍另項核。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi:p007:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"建武中明帝巡行任務，年號明綁齊君，不宋明帝"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi:p007:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"沖之","kind":"person","person_id":"vcm_d77_tsz_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳具名字文逺及宋齊兩朝機械曆學官序，不與祖逖等同姓人接"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-zuchongzhi"},{"text":"九年復北使。建武初，為王玄邈安北長史、廣陵太守。明帝以其在事無啟奏，代還責之，昭明曰：「臣不欲競執關鍵故耳。」昭明曆郡皆清勤，常謂人曰：「人生何事須聚畜，一身之外亦復何須。子孫若不才，我聚彼散。若能自立，則不如一經。」故終身一不事產業。中興二年卒。子子野。","source_position":{"start":9991,"end":10126,"raw":"九年復北使。建武初，為王玄邈安北長史、廣陵太守。明帝以其在事無啟奏，代還責之，昭明曰：「臣不欲競執關鍵故耳。」昭明曆郡皆清勤，常謂人曰：「人生何事須聚畜，一身之外亦復何須。子孫若不才，我聚彼散。若能自立，則不如一經。」故終身一不事產業。{{YL|中興二年}}卒。子子野。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"王玄邈","kind":"person","person_id":"hgq_k4y_crp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"建武初昭明為王玄邈安北長史，名、官及時段暫登來源內身份，不與不相干同姓者合併。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"南齊書卷6固定2311630正文高宗明皇帝諱鸞，建武元年即位；南史昭明建武初代還責之的明帝與同朝同年號相合，辨鸞；本篇明帝原字不改。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"駰子昭明、昭明子子野；梁030首段子野父昭明及祖駰同近世家系，父疾故事亦相合。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"駰子昭明、昭明子子野；梁030首段子野父昭明及祖駰同近世家系，父疾故事亦相合。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"昭明","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"駰子昭明、昭明子子野；梁030首段子野父昭明及祖駰同近世家系，父疾故事亦相合。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"駰子昭明、昭明子子野；梁030首段子野父昭明及祖駰同近世家系，父疾故事亦相合。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"昭明","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"駰子昭明、昭明子子野；梁030首段子野父昭明及祖駰同近世家系，父疾故事亦相合。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"我","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"駰子昭明、昭明子子野；梁030首段子野父昭明及祖駰同近世家系，父疾故事亦相合。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p013:m0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p003","text":"初，武興王楊集始為楊靈珍所破，降於蕭鸞。至是，率賊萬餘自漢中而北，規復舊土。椿領步騎五千出頓下辨，貽書集始，開以利害。集始執書對使者曰：「楊使君此書，除我心腹之疾。」遂領其部曲千餘人來降。尋以母老，解還。後武都氐楊會反，假椿節、冠軍將軍、都督西征諸軍事、行梁州刺史，與軍司羊祉討破之。於後梁州運糧，為羣氐劫奪，詔椿兼征虜將軍，持節招慰。尋以氐叛，拜光祿大夫，假平西將軍，督征討諸軍事以討之。還，兼太僕卿。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"revision_id":2087998,"raw_start":4031,"raw_end":4233,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[4031,4032,4033,4034,4035,4036,4037,4038,4039,4040,4041,4042,4043,4044,4045,4046,4047,4048,4049,4050,4051,4052,4053,4054,4055,4056,4057,4058,4059,4060,4061,4062,4063,4064,4065,4066,4067,4068,4069,4070,4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078,4079,4080,4081,4082,4083,4084,4085,4086,4087,4088,4089,4090,4091,4092,4093,4094,4095,4096,4097,4098,4099,4100,4101,4102,4103,4104,4105,4106,4107,4108,4109,4110,4111,4112,4113,4114,4115,4116,4117,4118,4119,4120,4121,4122,4123,4124,4125,4126,4127,4128,4129,4130,4131,4132,4133,4134,4135,4136,4137,4138,4139,4140,4141,4142,4143,4144,4145,4146,4147,4148,4149,4150,4151,4152,4153,4154,4155,4156,4157,4158,4159,4160,4161,4162,4163,4164,4165,4166,4167,4168,4169,4170,4171,4172,4173,4174,4175,4176,4177,4178,4179,4180,4181,4182,4183,4184,4185,4186,4187,4188,4189,4190,4191,4192,4193,4194,4195,4196,4197,4198,4199,4200,4201,4202,4203,4204,4205,4206,4207,4208,4209,4210,4211,4212,4213,4214,4215,4216,4217,4218,4219,4220,4221,4222,4223,4224,4225,4226,4227,4228,4229,4230,4231,4232],"projection_sh